  'route.updates': 'Changes to your trip',
  'route.privacy': 'Privacy and data',
  'route.print': 'Paper copies',
  'alt.boardingPass': 'Bring your booking number and photo ID to the terminal. Guest Services can print a new pass, and the paper copy from the Paper copies screen works too.',
  'alt.todaysEvents': 'Pick up the printed daily plan from Guest Services or the Piazza, or print it from Paper copies before you sail.',
  'alt.myReservations': 'Ask at the restaurant host stand, the Shore Excursions desk (Deck 9) or Guest Services. They can read out every booking you hold.',
  'alt.orderFood': 'Call room service on the stateroom phone, or sit at any dining venue. The Lido on Deck 17 serves without a booking.',
  'alt.askForHelp': 'Call Guest Services from any ship phone, or go to the desk on Deck 6. The Help button in the app dials the same number.',
  'alt.myBill': 'Ask for a printed statement at Guest Services at any time, or check the bill on the stateroom TV.',
  'alt.deckMap': 'Deck plans are posted at every lift bank and in the printed daily plan. Any crew member will walk you to a place.',
  'alt.guestServices': 'Dial the Guest Services number from any ship phone, or visit the desk on Deck 6 forward, open all day.',
  'alt.changeDining': 'Tell the restaurant host stand or Guest Services. They can move, cancel or add a table, and the change is confirmed on paper.',
  'alt.findFamily': 'Agree a meeting place and time each morning, and write the stateroom number on a card for each child. Guest Services can page a person.',
  'alt.addPackage': 'Ask at Guest Services or the Princess Plus desk. They can add or upgrade a package for the whole booking.',
  'alt.allAboard': 'The all-aboard time is printed in the daily plan and shown on the gangway board and on the stateroom TV.',
  'alt.emergencyInfo': 'Your muster station is shown on the back of your stateroom door. The emergency numbers are on every ship phone.',
  'alt.myExcursions': 'Print your tour tickets from Paper copies, or collect them at the Shore Excursions desk. Show them at the meeting point.',
  'alt.textSize': 'Large-print menus and daily plans are free. Ask at Guest Services, or request them under Assistance before you sail.',
