  'priv.keep.title': 'Private notes and health details',
  'priv.keep.body': 'Your medical card, access needs, allergy flag, child brief, journal, reflections, contacts, calm profile, family-at-home contacts and concierge chats stay on this device. If you turn this on, a copy is also kept in your account, so your phone and your computer show the same things.',
  'priv.keep.who': 'Only you can read the copy. It is not shown to the ship, the cruise line or the others on your booking, and it is not used for marketing. This version keeps it with your other account data, not yet in a separate encrypted store. A medical card is health information, so turn this on only if you are comfortable with that.',
