  'priv.consents': 'What you have agreed to',
  'priv.region.title': 'Your rights in {region}',
  'priv.region.law.us': 'Privacy laws in the United States, such as the California CCPA and CPRA and the children’s privacy law COPPA, apply to what Princess keeps about you.',
