  'priv.storage': 'What this app stores on your device',
  'priv.storageBody': 'The app uses no cookies and no trackers. It saves your bookings, settings and copies of screens in this browser’s storage so they work without signal. “Wipe everything” removes all of it.',
  'priv.assistant': 'What the assistants send out',
  'priv.assistantBody': 'When you write to Stanley or the concierge, your message and the trip facts needed to answer it (the sailing, and for the concierge your party’s first names and ages) go to the service that powers the assistant. They do not include your passport, payment or health records. Please do not type those into a message.',
  'priv.signinRecords': 'Sign-in records',
