  'hub.guide.stranded.s3': 'Keep your passport and boarding pass with you. Ask where the ship goes next.',
  'hub.guide.stranded.s4': 'Ask the agent about the line’s policy on getting to the next port at your own cost.',
  'hub.guide.stranded.s5': 'Keep every receipt and write down the time. The delay record below can go with an insurance claim.',
