  'stanley.q.pg.S50.1': 'What does “I’m leaving the ship” do?',
  'stanley.a.pg.S50.1': 'It tells your travel party you are ashore, and saves your return times, boarding pass, tour codes and safety information on this phone so they work with no signal.',
