  'stanley.q.pg.S50.2': 'When do I need to be back?',
  'stanley.a.pg.S50.2': 'Before the all-aboard time, and ahead of that at the gangway or tender landing. The page lists each time in ship time and in local time.',
  'stanley.r.pg.S50.2': 'S37 S38',
  'stanley.q.pg.S50.3': 'Will this work with no signal?',
  'stanley.a.pg.S50.3': 'Yes, for what was saved: the page shows how much was saved and when. Connect and tap “Save again” to refresh it.',
  'stanley.r.pg.S50.3': 'S25 S26',
  'stanley.q.pg.S50.4': 'What if I am going to be late?',
  'stanley.a.pg.S50.4': 'Call Guest Services on the number shown, and go straight to the gangway or the ship’s agent at the pier. The steps are on this page.',
  'stanley.r.pg.S50.4': 'S32 S37',
